---
/**
 * tools/social-security-benefit-cap-proposal.astro
 * Authoritative Interactive Tool & Comprehensive Guide:
 * Social Security Benefit Cap Proposal & Solvency Calculator 2026
 * URL: /tools/social-security-benefit-cap-proposal/
